{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790560/extras/9a301b6d763a628d5f08591473033628.avif?t=1765305510\" width=800 height=59 /></span>Run, gun, dash, slide &amp; glide through a hallway filled to the brim with all types of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, throw grenades and drop mines while gliding through the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With quick reflexes and loads of movement options, avoid every obstacle like a pro.<br><br>Buck Buster just wanted to have a calm and peaceful day at his favorite place to work, the &quot;Endless Inn&quot; bar, when it suddenly got infested with all types of ugly enemies. SCREW THEM! Take back what's yours and bring back your customers to serve them drinks once again. Time to go all out with your trusted shotgun, grenades and mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790560/extras/3e7a01c822876450534be3564aeb3d0c.avif?t=1765305510\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tons of new weapons and upgrades to max out your arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item can be upgraded to further enhance its performance, giving you the edge that you need to reach new highscores in your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790560/extras/ee435f3035ed3ef95ecec3928f871abd.avif?t=1765305510\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring difficulty levels Easy, Medium and Hard, to match every player's indivitual skill level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fun is guaranteed for casual to professional gamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790560/extras/5b56df5425ec97261eeaeefaa6b2b263.avif?t=1765305510\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate the leaderboard by submitting your highscore after a great run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every difficulty level has it's own category on the leaderboard, making sure everyone can have a piece of the cake.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790560?t=1765305510","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790560/123fcdd2d3a1e415250802956f2a5e6335f871d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765305510","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790560/6020f05415332bf5a761591db550134367d1a455/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765305510","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790560/6020f05415332bf5a761591db550134367d1a455/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765305510","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790560/extras/9a301b6d763a628d5f08591473033628.avif?t=1765305510\" width=800 height=59 /></span>Run, gun, dash, slide &amp; glide through a hallway filled to the brim with all types of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, throw grenades and drop mines while gliding through the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With quick reflexes and loads of movement options, avoid every obstacle like a pro.<br><br>Buck Buster just wanted to have a calm and peaceful day at his favorite place to work, the &quot;Endless Inn&quot; bar, when it suddenly got infested with all types of ugly enemies. SCREW THEM! Take back what's yours and bring back your customers to serve them drinks once again. Time to go all out with your trusted shotgun, grenades and mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790560/extras/3e7a01c822876450534be3564aeb3d0c.avif?t=1765305510\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock tons of new weapons and upgrades to max out your arsenal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every item can be upgraded to further enhance its performance, giving you the edge that you need to reach new highscores in your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790560/extras/ee435f3035ed3ef95ecec3928f871abd.avif?t=1765305510\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring difficulty levels Easy, Medium and Hard, to match every player's indivitual skill level!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fun is guaranteed for casual to professional gamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790560/extras/5b56df5425ec97261eeaeefaa6b2b263.avif?t=1765305510\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominate the leaderboard by submitting your highscore after a great run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every difficulty level has it's own category on the leaderboard, making sure everyone can have a piece of the cake.</p>","developers":["Finbox Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description